msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Do you really want to power off the device?"
msgstr "确定要关闭设备吗？"

msgid "Failed to power off the device: %s"
msgstr "设备关机失败：%s"

msgid "No error output."
msgstr "没有错误输出。"

msgid "Power Off"
msgstr "关机"

msgid "Power off failed (exit code %s): %s"
msgstr "关机失败（退出码 %s）：%s"

msgid "Shutting down…"
msgstr "正在关机…"

msgid "The device is shutting down."
msgstr "设备正在关机。"

msgid "The device will power off. It will not start again until power is cycled or the power button is pressed."
msgstr "设备将关闭电源。关机后，需要重新接通电源或按下电源按钮才能再次启动。"
